<title>GERMANY: B.U.S. says 95/96 net profit up 53 pct.</title>
<headline>B.U.S. says 95/96 net profit up 53 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year</p>
<p>1995/1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   24.4    up 53 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				 336.0    up 38 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend on ordinary shares	   0.40     vs 0.20 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares	 0.50     vs 0.30 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German waste recycling company B.U.S. Berzelius Umwelt Service AG. The group's business year ends on September 30.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
